42,
"- 2026-10-31: State what a CI job did from that job's own log on both runs — a step's `completed · skipped` or `success`, the runner image and agent versions, a `df` line — never from the workflow YAML or one failing run: an `if:` can name no row that runs, and two jobs of one run can stand on different images.",
43
]
